  {
    "doc_id": "VN_N_27_2007_ART_003",
    "jurisdiction": "越南",
    "law_id": "VN_N_27_2007",
    "law_name": "On e-transactions in financial activities",
    "law_name_original": "On e-transactions in financial activities",
    "law_type": "N",
    "article_number": "3",
    "article_number_normalized": "003",
    "article_title": ".-",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "chapter": "",
    "chapter_title": "",
    "text_zh": "",
    "text_pt": "",
    "text_en": "Interpretation of terms\n\nIn this Decree, the terms below are construed as follows:\n\n1. \"E-voucher\" means information created, transmitted, received and stored by electronic means in financial activities. E-vouchers\nconstitute a form of data message, including electronic accounting vouchers; e-vouchers on budget revenues and expenditures; information\non electronic declaration and clearance of customs procedures; information on electronic declaration and clearance of tax procedures;\ne-vouchers on securities transactions; electronic financial statements; electronic settlement reports and other kinds of e-vouchers\nin conformity with each type of transactions prescribed by law.\n\n2. \"Financial agency\" means an agency performing the state management of finance.",
    "text_original_language": "en",
    "word_count_zh": 0,
    "chunk_type": "substantive",
    "is_substantive": true,
    "sub_chunks": [
      {
        "marker": "1",
        "content": "\"E-voucher\" means information created, transmitted, received and stored by electronic means in financial activities. E-vouchers\nconstitute a form of data message, including electronic accounting vouchers; e-vouchers on budget revenues and expenditures; information\non electronic declaration and clearance of customs procedures; information on electronic declaration and clearance of tax procedures;\ne-vouchers on securities transactions; electronic financial statements; electronic settlement reports and other kinds of e-vouchers\nin conformity with each type of transactions prescribed by law."
      },
      {
        "marker": "2",
        "content": "\"Financial agency\" means an agency performing the state management of finance."
      }
    ],
